<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Utils on 黄石的时空回环</title><link>https://yzlnew.com/tags/utils/</link><description>Recent content in Utils on 黄石的时空回环. feedId:68921589691341824+userId:60978964020972544</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><copyright>© Copyright Ye Zhiling</copyright><lastBuildDate>Tue, 09 Mar 2021 13:18:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://yzlnew.com/tags/utils/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>发现、解决、习惯，思维方式改造生活</title><link>https://yzlnew.com/2021/02/%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A0%E6%83%AF%E6%80%9D%E7%BB%B4%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E6%94%B9%E9%80%A0%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB/</link><pubDate>Fri, 26 Feb 2021 21:18:58 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://yzlnew.com/2021/02/%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E4%B9%A0%E6%83%AF%E6%80%9D%E7%BB%B4%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E6%94%B9%E9%80%A0%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB/</guid><description>&lt;aside class="notice notice-info" aria-label="说明"&gt;&lt;span class="notice-label"&gt;说明&lt;/span&gt;&lt;p&gt;本文参加少数派年度征文。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>用 duti 管理 macOS 下的默认打开程序</title><link>https://yzlnew.com/2017/09/%E7%94%A8-duti-%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-macos-%E4%B8%8B%E7%9A%84%E9%BB%98%E8%AE%A4%E6%89%93%E5%BC%80%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F/</link><pubDate>Mon, 25 Sep 2017 18:52:54 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yzlnew.com/2017/09/%E7%94%A8-duti-%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-macos-%E4%B8%8B%E7%9A%84%E9%BB%98%E8%AE%A4%E6%89%93%E5%BC%80%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;macOS&lt;/code&gt;下管理文件的默认打开程序不是很方便，不过有了&lt;code&gt;duti&lt;/code&gt;就可以通过配置文件来更改默认打开程序了。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>鼠须管 Rime 主题</title><link>https://yzlnew.com/2016/09/%E9%BC%A0%E9%A1%BB%E7%AE%A1-rime-%E4%B8%BB%E9%A2%98/</link><pubDate>Mon, 26 Sep 2016 18:35:59 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yzlnew.com/2016/09/%E9%BC%A0%E9%A1%BB%E7%AE%A1-rime-%E4%B8%BB%E9%A2%98/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;因为搜狗输入法在更新了 macOS 之后切换有点卡，再加上之前的皮肤不知道怎么的就被搜狗更新覆盖了。所以就找出鼠须管用吧。偶然发现皮肤还是挺好配的。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>利用 TikZ 宏包在 LaTeX 中绘制流程图</title><link>https://yzlnew.com/2016/06/%E5%88%A9%E7%94%A8-tikz-%E5%AE%8F%E5%8C%85%E5%9C%A8-latex-%E4%B8%AD%E7%BB%98%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%E5%9B%BE/</link><pubDate>Wed, 22 Jun 2016 09:37:35 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yzlnew.com/2016/06/%E5%88%A9%E7%94%A8-tikz-%E5%AE%8F%E5%8C%85%E5%9C%A8-latex-%E4%B8%AD%E7%BB%98%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%E5%9B%BE/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;本来打算把在毕设过程中零零碎碎学到或者用到的东西记录下来，没想到还是太懒，到最后就忘记要写什么了。由于在毕设论文中用到了流程图，就在网上找了找用 LaTeX 画流程图的方法，这里简单分享下。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>